<li>Flowers &amp; Bird (Xi Shang Mei Shao) Metropolitan Museum of Art</li>
<li>Immortals Celebrating a Birthday Indianapolis Museum of Art</li>
<li>Lady Xuanwen Jun Giving Instructions on the Classics Cleveland Museum of Art</li>
<li>Master Laozi on the Back of Ox Cleveland Museum of Art</li>
<li>The Mountain of the Five Cataracts Cleveland Museum of Art</li>
<li>The Dragon King Revering the Buddha Freer Gallery of Art</li>
</ul>
